Output demos/sparkline.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 620
Set Height 320
Set FontSize 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "./target/debug/examples/demo sparkline"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 800ms
Left
Sleep 900ms
Left
Sleep 1200ms
Right
Sleep 700ms
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
